7 15 FUNCTION UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
16 28 IDENT NO_KEYWORD
28 29 ASCII_40 NO_KEYWORD
29 30 ASCII_41 NO_KEYWORD
31 38 RETURNS UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
39 42 INT_P COL_NAME_KEYWORD
43 51 LANGUAGE UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
52 59 IDENT NO_KEYWORD
60 62 AS RESERVED_KEYWORD
63 311 SCONST NO_KEYWORD
